    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Powerful wards hide a creature from magic that would spy on it or affect its mind. The target gains a +4 status bonus to saves against mental effects. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hidden mind",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " attempts to counteract any detection, revelation, and scrying effects as if its spell rank were 1 higher than its actual rank. On a success, the effect functions normally except that it detects nothing about the target and its possessions. For instance, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "detect magic",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " would still detect other magic in the area, but not any magic on the target."
          }
        ]
      },
